  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The rehablitation of Arpa_Seven tunnel project - Rehabilitation and operation of 48 km Erba - Sevan tunnel, the project has an economic and environmental importance, whereas the water level is expected to rise about 6 meters over 30 years.</narrative>
